# Open Hadith — the repository cites its sources, it does not carry them.
# See docs/terms.md (Source Witness) and docs/layers.md (Sources).

# Everything under sources/ is excluded by default, so no scan, PDF, or other
# copy of a published edition can be committed by accident. Witness definitions
# are re-included below: they describe an edition, they do not reproduce it.
sources/**
!sources/**/
!sources/**/*.json
!sources/**/*.md

# Operating system artifacts.
.DS_Store
